flowchart TD
    Caller([Caller Audio In]) --> LB[Nginx Load Balancer]
    LB --> ASR[ASR Model Pool]
    ASR --> ORCH[LangGraph Orchestrator<br/>Intent Detection]
    ORCH -->|tool call| KB[(Knowledge Retrieval / RAG)]
    ORCH -->|tool call| CRM[(CRM & Ticketing APIs)]
    KB --> ORCH
    CRM --> ORCH
    ORCH --> LLM[LLM Response Composition]
    LLM --> TTS[TTS Model Pool]
    TTS --> LB
    LB --> CallerOut([Caller Audio Out])

    ASR -.metrics.-> MON[Prometheus + Grafana]
    LLM -.metrics.-> MON
    TTS -.metrics.-> MON

    style MON fill:#111827,stroke:#22D3EE,color:#E5E7EB
    style ORCH fill:#111827,stroke:#6366F1,color:#E5E7EB
